@startuml redis-hold-flow
!include _style.puml
title Redis Atomic Hold Flow
start
:Validate JWT Student, slot grid, horizon;
:Validate Tutor subject + availability;
:Query confirmed overlap in SchedulingDb;
if (Dependency valid?) then (yes)
  :Lua checks tutor/student overlap keys\n(start-30, start, start+30);
  if (Any lock exists?) then (yes)
    :Return 409 + remaining PTTL;
    stop
  else (no)
    :SET tutor locks NX PX 300000;
    :SET student locks NX PX 300000;
    :SET hold metadata + tokenHash PX 300000;
    :Return 201 holdId, one-time token, expiresAtUtc;
  endif
else (no)
  :Return 422 or 503;
endif
stop

legend bottom
Redis hold hỗ trợ UX và giảm contention.
PostgreSQL exclusion constraint vẫn là nguồn quyết định khi confirm.
Release chỉ compare-and-delete đúng owner/token; commit DB trước release.
endlegend
@enduml

